    "details": "<p>Quasar 5.0 is the flagship annual hackathon organized by Vasantdada Patil Pratishthan&rsquo;s College of Engineering and Visual Arts, scheduled for <strong>23&ndash;24 January 2027</strong>. This 36-hour hackathon provides a dynamic platform for students, developers, designers, and innovators to collaborate, think creatively, and develop technology-driven solutions to real-world challenges.</p>\n<p>The event encourages innovation, teamwork, technical excellence, and entrepreneurial thinking while enabling participants to showcase their skills and compete for a <strong>prize pool of ₹1,50,000</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> 36 hours</li>\n<li><strong>Event Dates:</strong> 23&ndash;24 January 2027</li>\n<li><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Completely free</li>\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Offline hackathon</li>\n<li><strong>Prize Pool:</strong> ₹1,50,000</li>\n<li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Inter-college and inter-organization teams, subject to official rules</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Links:</strong></p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 3 []\"><strong>Important Links:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions <a href=\"https://quasar-vppcoe.vercel.app/#terms\">(Click Here)</a></strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Official WhatsApp Group <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/K3sHKGtXYJ06l02R2eLmVA\">(click Here)</a></strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Instagram:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/quasar_vppcoe?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&amp;exln=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw==\">@quasar_pvppcoe</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Join Quasar 5.0 and turn your ideas into impactful innovations through 36 hours of collaboration, creativity, and problem-solving.</p>",
